                      (∀ (N : ℕ), eLpNorm (K N) (ENNReal.ofReal qord) ↑(chaosSampleLaw M) ≤ ENNReal.ofReal Cbound) ∧
                        ∀ᵐ (omega : BilateralField d) ∂(chaosSampleLaw M).toMeasure,
