              (aux_lem_band_U2N_zn d) 1).coeffOn (Homogenization.originCube d 0)) 0 pvec - (0 : ℝ) -
            Y2 omega) (ENNReal.ofReal (2 * q)) (chaosSampleLaw M).toMeasure ≤
